# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kannada Saathi — optional configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app needs NO environment variables. Every feature (phrasebook, search,
# role-play, quiz, voice practice, favourites, offline assistant) works from
# bundled data with no backend, API key or account.
#
# Copy to .env.local only if you want to override the static asset base path.
# The default './' makes one build work at a domain root, on a sub-path such as
# GitHub Pages, and even from a file served on a college LAN.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#VITE_BASE_PATH=./
